---
import SiteLayout from '@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import InfoPage from '@/components/InfoPage.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
---

<SiteLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for the static LLM Advisor website." canonicalPath="/privacy">
  <InfoPage title="Privacy Policy" description="LLM Advisor is designed as a static website and does not require user accounts or server-side data storage.">
    <h2>Static website model</h2>
    <p>LLM Advisor does not provide login, payment, or account features. The website is intended to run as a static GitHub Pages-compatible site.</p>
    <h2>Analytics, advertising, and third parties</h2>
    <p>LLM Advisor may use Google Analytics to understand aggregate website usage. Analytics may collect basic usage information such as pages visited, device and browser information, referral information, and approximate geography.</p>
    <p>The site may display ads through Google AdSense. Google and other third-party vendors may use cookies or similar technologies to serve ads, measure ad performance, and limit repeat ad delivery. You can manage ad personalization through your browser settings and through <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p>
    <p>Advertising does not determine editorial recommendations on LLM Advisor. Pricing comparisons, calculators, and recommendations should remain source-based and methodology-driven. If affiliate links or sponsored placements are introduced later, they will be disclosed clearly before they appear on affected pages.</p>
    <p>You can control cookies and tracking through your browser settings and other privacy tools.</p>
    <h2>Contact and corrections</h2>
    <p>If you email <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>, the information you send will be used to review and respond to your request. Do not send private account credentials, API keys, or confidential vendor contracts.</p>
  </InfoPage>
</SiteLayout>
